<title>INDIA: SQUASH-MAHINDRA INTERNATIONAL SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-MAHINDRA INTERNATIONAL SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY, India 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>Mahindra international squash tournament on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Simon Parke (England) beat Amir Wagih (Egypt) 15-6 15-6 10-15</p>
<p>9-15 15-9</p>
<p>Zubair Jahan (Pakistan) beat Zarak Jahan (Pakistan) 15-12 15-8</p>
<p>15-12</p>
<p>Ahmed Barada (Egypt) beat Mark Chaloner (England) 15-14 7-15</p>
<p>9-15 15-11 15-12</p>
<p>Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat Stephen Meads (England) 15-5 15-9</p>
<p>15-8</p>
</text>
